    "narrative": "The standout play for the Austin Waves today is **Gunnar Henderson**, who earns our highest confidence rating at 81.88. Facing Gray, a moderate matchup, **Gunnar Henderson** benefits significantly from an elite park factor (+16%) and a favorable platoon dynamic, making him the cornerstone of our lineup. **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** (68.14) and **Heliot Ramos** (62.21) also provide strong production. **Heliot Ramos** is particularly intriguing against Ray; while the park factor is slightly negative, the 4.90 xERA of the opposing pitcher allows his underlying metrics to shine, resulting in a healthy 19% boost from the matchup.\n\nOur decision-making process continues to prioritize efficiency as we manage our game caps. **Liam Hicks** (39.70) fell just short of our 40.0 floor, effectively benched because his matchup against the elite deGrom (3.15 xERA) stifled his upside, despite a decent platoon advantage. We also remain cautious with **Drake Baldwin** (49.38) and **Dominic Smith** (42.10) as they face Wheeler; while both hold marginal value, their proximity to our floor indicates that they are strictly situational plays today. We are tracking the SB potential of **Miguel Vargas** and **Jackson Merrill** closely; both carry a \"Slow SP Delivery\" bonus (+2%) which, given the scarcity of stolen bases in our league, elevates their relative value even when their raw scoring projections hover near the 50-point mark.\n\nRisks for today center on the top-tier arms facing our lineup. Both **Drake Baldwin** and **Dominic Smith** are battling a significant -18% penalty due to the skill level of Wheeler, which underscores why we are not expecting fireworks from the bottom of our order. Ensure that **Luis Robert Jr.** and **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** remain cleared from your active slots, as their zero-score status reflects confirmed benching or roster unavailability. The Waves are positioned for a high-floor outcome, provided **Gunnar Henderson** and **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** capitalize on their prime batting order placements.",
